   "DELETE /api/platform/complaints/:id id:id": "By design (awaiting the tech lead): a complaint is never deleted, so DELETE answers 405 COMPLAINT_KEPT for every id, malformed or not; the same answer for any id says nothing about which ids exist (PF-21w).",
   "GET /api/public/invitations/:token id:token": "By design (awaiting the tech lead): an invitation token is a 256-bit random string, not a uuid; a token that is not live answers 200 with its state (NOT_VALID for an unknown or malformed one, EXPIRED for an expired one), so the accept page shows its own words and a bad token tells nothing (PF-4b).",
   "POST /api/front-office/prospects/:id/convert missing": "By design (awaiting the tech lead): {} is a valid Convert body (the version is optional; check_csk1s_clients_browser and check_fo13s_identity_browser send {}), so with the sweep's random id the honest answer is 404 (PF-28 part 3a).",
   "POST /api/platform/session/callback missing": "By design (awaiting the tech lead): a sign-in door answers its own status: no code is the callback's 401 SIGN_IN_CODE_REFUSED (check_forms_qa53 DOORS; batch 44935069729 on #2787), never a field error; an unknown field or a wrong type is still 422.",
   "POST /api/platform/staff/invitations/:id/resend missing": "By design (awaiting the tech lead): {} is a valid resend body (the reason is optional; the web sends {}), so with the sweep's random id the honest answer is 404; question on #2787.",
   "POST /api/public/invitations/:token/accept id:token": "By design (awaiting the tech lead): accepting a token that is not live answers 410 INVITATION_NOT_VALID, the same for a malformed, unknown, used or expired token (PF-4b, PF-6m2).",
   "POST /api/public/messages/ses-notices 1mb": "By design (awaiting the tech lead): the SNS door keeps AWS's own 300 KB limit and checks the signature first; an unsigned body is 400 'not signed by Amazon SNS' before anything is read (PF-19b part 2).",
   "POST /api/public/messages/ses-notices missing": "By design (awaiting the tech lead): the SNS signature is checked before any field is read, so an unsigned body is 400 'not signed by Amazon SNS', never a field error (PF-19b part 2, AG-10-32).",
   "POST /api/public/messages/ses-notices unknown": "By design (awaiting the tech lead): the SNS signature is checked before any field is read, so an unsigned body is 400 'not signed by Amazon SNS', never a field error (PF-19b part 2, AG-10-32).",
   "POST /api/public/messages/ses-notices wrong-type": "By design (awaiting the tech lead): the SNS signature is checked before any field is read, so an unsigned body is 400 'not signed by Amazon SNS', never a field error (PF-19b part 2, AG-10-32)."
